  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here's the header when I GET the binary node URI: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Link: <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/content/fcr:metadata"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/content/fcr:metadata",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">; rel=\"describedby\" ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When I request the binary URI under a version (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/fcr:versions/87a0a8c317f1e7e3193515-7815-4475-8950-95698c75d2e1/content),"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8983/fedora/rest/dev/8f/49/84/e2/8f4984e2-5fbc-4e6f-bbc1-6b392b580f2a/fcr:versions/87a0a8c317f1e7e3193515-7815-4475-8950-95698c75d2e1/content),",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " the describedby link is absent, although the correct info under the predicate ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.iana.org/assignments/relation/describedby"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.iana.org/assignments/relation/describedby",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " exists at {version_uri}/fcr:metadata. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "[See also fedora-tech https://groups.google.com/d/topic/fedora-tech/2MIgi-i6HPU/discussion]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The inconsistency of responses causes consuming applications to assume the metadata node for the vesrioned binary is located at '/fcr:metadata'.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
